| `deploy-stale/` | alias |
EOF
  n=$(check_deploy_variants "$tmp/deploy-tree" | wc -l)
  (( n >= 3 )) || { echo "self-test: check_deploy_variants fired $n times, expected ≥3"; out=1; }

  echo "# old" > "$tmp/deploy-tree/deploy-old/README.md"
  cat > "$tmp/deploy-tree/docs/repo-map.md" <<'EOF'
# Map

## Deployment variants

| Directory | Kind |
| --- | --- |
